rix}</annotation></semantics></math></span><br></p><p><span data-pres-font=\"&quot;Aptos&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Calibri, Arial, sans-serif\" style=\"font-family: Aptos, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Calibri, Arial, sans-serif !important;\">Gesamtbedarf:</span></p><p>\n<span class=\"pres-math\" data-pres-math=\"1\" contenteditable=\"false\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>G</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r=G\\cdot x</annotation></semantics></math></span></p><p><br></p>&nbsp;<span class=\"pres-math\" data-pres-math=\"1\" contenteditable=\"false\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.16em\" columnalign=\"center center\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mn>42</mn></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mn>27</mn></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mn>22</mn></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mn>32</mn></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mn>26</mn></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mn>20</mn></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mn>4</mn></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mn>10</mn></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>⋅</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.16em\" columnalign=\"center\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mn>100</mn></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mn>80</mn></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r=\n\\begin{pmatrix}\n42 &amp; 27\\\\\n22 &amp; 32\\\\\n26 &amp; 20\\\\\n4 &amp; 10\n\\end{pmatrix}\n\\cdot\n\\begin{pmatrix}\n100\\\\\n80\n\\end{pmatrix}</annotation></semantics></math></span><br><p></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p></p><p><span data-pres-font=\"&quot;Aptos&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Calibri, Arial, sans-serif\" style=\"font-family: Aptos, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Calibri, Arial, sans-serif !important;\"><b>Ergebnis</b></span></p>\n<p><span data-pres-font=\"&quot;Aptos&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Calibri, Arial, sans-serif\" style=\"font-family: Aptos, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Calibri, Arial, sans-serif !important;\">Für die Bestellung von <strong>100 Edlen Mischungen</strong> und <strong>80 Süßen Mischungen</strong> werden benötigt:</span></p>\n<div role=\"presentation\" data-stable-ignore=\"true\" data-tabster=\"{&quot;restorer&quot;:{&quot;type&quot;:1}}\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<table node=\"[object Object]\" markdown=\"| Rohstoff | Bedarf |\n|------|------:|\n| Kakaopulver | 6.360 g |\n| Kakaobutter | 4.760 g |\n| Zucker | 4.200 g |\n| Milchpulver | 1.200 g |\" data-pres-table=\"1\" data-pres-table-theme=\"gelb\" style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; table-layout: fixed; font-size: inherit;\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 50%;\"><col style=\"width: 50%;\"></colgroup><thead><tr><th style=\"border: 1px solid rgb(232, 192, 112); padding: 8px 10px; background-color: rgb(255, 229, 153); font-weight: 700; vertical-align: middle; word-break: break-word; text-align: left;\"><span data-pres-font=\"&quot;Aptos&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Calibri, Arial, sans-serif\" style=\"font-family: Aptos, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Calibri, Arial, sans-serif !important;\">Rohstoff</span></th><th style=\"border: 1px solid rgb(232, 192, 112); padding: 8px 10px; background-color: rgb(255, 229, 153); font-weight: 700; vertical-align: middle; word-break: break-word; text-align: left;\"><span data-pres-font=\"&quot;Aptos&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Calibri, Arial, sans-serif\" style=\"font-family: Aptos, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Calibri, Arial, sans-serif !important;\">Bedarf</span></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid rgb(232, 192, 112); padding: 8px 10px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); vertical-align: middle; word-break: break-word;\"><span data-pres-font=\"&quot;Aptos&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Calibri, Arial, sans-serif\" style=\"font-family: Aptos, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Calibri, Arial, sans-serif !important;\">Kakaopulver</span></td><td style=\"border: 1px solid rgb(232, 192, 112); padding: 8px 10px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); vertical-align: middle; word-break: break-word;\"><span data-pres-font=\"&quot;Aptos&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Calibri, Arial, sans-serif\" style=\"font-family: Aptos, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Calibri, Arial, sans-serif !important;\">6.360 g</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid rgb(232, 192, 112); padding: 8px 10px; background-color: rgb(255, 242, 204); vertical-align: middle; word-break: break-word;\"><span data-pres-font=\"&quot;Aptos&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Calibri, Arial, sans-serif\" style=\"font-family: Aptos, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Calibri, Arial, sans-serif !important;\">Kakaobutter</span></td><td style=\"border: 1px solid rgb(232, 192, 112); padding: 8px 10px; background-color: rgb(255, 242, 204); vertical-align: middle; word-break: break-word;\"><span data-pres-font=\"&quot;Aptos&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Calibri, Arial, sans-serif\" style=\"font-family: Aptos, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Calibri, Arial, sans-serif !important;\">4.760 g</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid rgb(232, 192, 112); padding: 8px 10px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); vertical-align: middle; word-break: break-word;\"><span data-pres-font=\"&quot;Aptos&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Calibri, Arial, sans-serif\" style=\"font-family: Aptos, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Calibri, Arial, sans-serif !important;\">Zucker</span></td><td style=\"border: 1px solid rgb(232, 192, 112); padding: 8px 10px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); vertical-align: middle; word-break: break-word;\"><span data-pres-font=\"&quot;Aptos&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Calibri, Arial, sans-serif\" style=\"font-family: Aptos, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Calibri, Arial, sans-serif !important;\">4.200 g</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid rgb(232, 192, 112); padding: 8px 10px; background-color: rgb(255, 242, 204); vertical-align: middle; word-break: break-word;\"><span data-pres-font=\"&quot;Aptos&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Calibri, Arial, sans-serif\" style=\"font-family: Aptos, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Calibri, Arial, sans-serif !important;\">Milchpulver</span></td><td style=\"border: 1px solid rgb(232, 192, 112); padding: 8px 10px; background-color: rgb(255, 242, 204); vertical-align: middle; word-break: break-word;\"><span data-pres-font=\"&quot;Aptos&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Calibri, Arial, sans-serif\" style=\"font-family: Aptos, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Calibri, Arial, sans-serif !important;\">1.200 g</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div><br><p></p></b><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><div>____________________________________________________________</div><div><p><span data-pres-font=\"&quot;Aptos&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Calibri, Arial, sans-serif\" style=\"font-family: Aptos, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Calibri, Arial, sans-serif !important;\"><b>Weg 1: Zweistufige Rechnung</b></span></p>\n<p><span data-pres-font=\"&quot;Aptos&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Calibri, Arial, sans-serif\" style=\"font-family: Aptos, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Calibri, Arial, sans-serif !important;\">Zuerst wird aus der Bestellung der Bedarf an Schokoladensorten berechnet. Anschließend wird aus diesem Schokoladenbedarf der Rohstoffbedarf bestimmt.</span></p>\n<p><span data-pres-font=\"&quot;Aptos&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Calibri, Arial, sans-serif\" style=\"font-family: Aptos, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Calibri, Arial, sans-serif !important;\">Mathematisch:</span></p><p>\n<span class=\"pres-math\" data-pres-math=\"1\" contenteditable=\"false\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Rohstoffbedarf</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Rohstoffbedarf}\n= A \\cdot (B \\cdot x)</annotation></semantics></math></span>&nbsp;</p><p><span data-pres-font=\"&quot;Aptos&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Calibri, Arial, sans-serif\" style=\"font-family: Aptos, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Calibri, Arial, sans-serif !important;\">Dabei ist</span></p>\n<ul><li><span data-pres-font=\"&quot;Aptos&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Calibri, Arial, sans-serif\" style=\"font-family: Aptos, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Calibri, Arial, sans-serif !important;\"><span class=\"pres-math\" data-pres-math=\"1\" contenteditable=\"false\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span>: Rohstoffe → Schokoladensorten</span></li><li><span data-pres-font=\"&quot;Aptos&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Calibri, Arial, sans-serif\" style=\"font-family: Aptos, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Calibri, Arial, sans-serif !important;\"><span class=\"pres-math\" data-pres-math=\"1\" contenteditable=\"false\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span>: Schokoladensorten → Pralinenpackungen</span></li><li><span data-pres-font=\"&quot;Aptos&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Calibri, Arial, sans-serif\" style=\"font-family: Aptos, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Calibri, Arial, sans-serif !important;\"><span class=\"pres-math\" data-pres-math=\"1\" contenteditable=\"false\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span>: Bestellvektor</span></li></ul>\n<hr>\n<p><span data-pres-font=\"&quot;Aptos&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Calibri, Arial, sans-serif\" style=\"font-family: Aptos, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Calibri, Arial, sans-serif !important;\"><b>Weg 2: Gesamtbedarfsmatrix</b></span></p>\n<p><span data-pres-font=\"&quot;Aptos&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Calibri, Arial, sans-serif\" style=\"font-family: Aptos, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Calibri, Arial, sans-serif !important;\">Zunächst werden die beiden Teilbedarfsmatrizen zu einer Gesamtbedarfsmatrix zusammengefasst:</span></p><p>\n<span class=\"pres-math\" data-pres-math=\"1\" contenteditable=\"false\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G=A\\cdot B.</annotation></semantics></math></span></p><p><span data-pres-font=\"&quot;Aptos&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Calibri, Arial, sans-serif\" style=\"font-family: Aptos, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Calibri, Arial, sans-serif !important;\">Dann genügt eine einzige Matrixmultiplikation:</span></p><p>\n<span class=\"pres-math\" data-pres-math=\"1\" contenteditable=\"false\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Rohstoffbedarf</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>G</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Rohstoffbedarf}\n= G \\cdot x.</annotation></semantics></math></span></p><p><br></p><p></p><p><span data-pres-font=\"&quot;Aptos&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Calibri, Arial, sans-serif\" style=\"font-family: Aptos, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Calibri, Arial, sans-serif !important;\"><b>Begründung</b></span></p>\n<p><span data-pres-font=\"&quot;Aptos&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Calibri, Arial, sans-serif\" style=\"font-family: Aptos, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Calibri, Arial, sans-serif !important;\">Beide Wege liefern dasselbe Ergebnis, weil die Matrixmultiplikation <strong>assoziativ</strong> ist:</span></p><p>\n<span class=\"pres-math\" data-pres-math=\"1\" contenteditable=\"false\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A\\cdot(B\\cdot x)\n=\n(A\\cdot B)\\cdot x.</annotation></semantics></math></span></p><p><span data-pres-font=\"&quot;Aptos&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Calibri, Arial, sans-serif\" style=\"font-family: Aptos, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Calibri, Arial, sans-serif !important;\">Deshalb kann man entweder</span></p>\n<ol><li><span data-pres-font=\"&quot;Aptos&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Calibri, Arial, sans-serif\" style=\"font-family: Aptos, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Calibri, Arial, sans-serif !important;\">die Berechnung Schritt für Schritt entlang der Produktionsstufen durchführen oder</span></li><li><span data-pres-font=\"&quot;Aptos&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Calibri, Arial, sans-serif\" style=\"font-family: Aptos, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Calibri, Arial, sans-serif !important;\">die Produktionsstufen zunächst zu einer Gesamtbedarfsmatrix zusammenfassen.</span></li></ol>\n<p><br></p><br><p></p><br></div>","preparationNotes":"","preparationHtml":"<p><br></p>","materialNotes":"","materialHtml":"<p><br></p>","elements":[],"transition":"fade","revealEnabled":true,"zoneRevealSteps":{}},"strokes":[]}}}